The iterator from `ctx.GetStub().GetStateByPartialCompositeKey("Asset", []string{fromOwner})` at line 110 is never closed. Three error paths (lines 113, 118, 125) return without cleanup. Although this uses a different query method, the iterator still holds gRPC streams and database resources.

