**Description:**
The iterator from `ctx.GetStub().GetStateByRange(startKey, endKey)` at line 141 is never closed. Two exit paths (lines 144, 150) and an error path within the loop (line 150) all leak the iterator. This is particularly dangerous in a write-heavy operation that may be called frequently.

**Recommended Fix:**
