|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Nested map iteration (outer+inner) | Non-Determinism | Critical | `BatchUpdateInventory` | Medium |
| 2 | Report string generation from maps | Non-Determinism | Critical | `GenerateZoneReport` | Medium |
| 3 | Merged items write order | Non-Determinism | Critical | `MergeZones` | Medium |
| 4 | Missing input validation | Input Validation | High | All functions | Low |

