The iterator from `ctx.GetStub().GetStateByPartialCompositeKey()` at line 109 is never closed. This function has three error exit paths (lines 111, 117, 125) and one normal exit (line 132), none of which close the iterator. The leak occurs even though this uses a different query method—all iterators must be explicitly closed.

